thing like ralph northam in august  telling me no terry mclaughlin's going  to win we've got this and when you don't  have it when president biden before he  gets on air force one says you know what  we're going to win virginia when i get  off the plane i'm going to see a victory  and he sees a loss that means you're not  seeing what's actually happening on the  ground that's a tell-tale lesson in  politics right politics they say it's a  blood sport and a little blood these  days thank you very much major

